  "prefLabel": "Nur 608.04 Nurse Extern Preceptor Qualifications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 608.04 Nurse Extern Preceptor Qualifications. Each nurse extern preceptor shall:\n\n(a) Be employed at a health care facility licensed, certified, or accredited by the appropriate New Hampshire authority;\n\n(b) Be in good standing as defined in RSA 310:2, I(d); and\n\n(c) Not have current or pending discipline by the board.\n\nSource. #13707, 9-27-23; ss by #14636, eff 8-24-26, EXPIRES: 8-24-36 (formerly Nur 608.05)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nur100-800.html"
